WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.900
Bartek would like to see a new film with Ania this weekend.

2
00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:10.110
Co robisz w sobotę? Może pójdziemy do kina?

3
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:14.520
Niestety w sobotę nie mogę. A może w piątek?

4
00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:18.750
She declines politely and offers another day.

5
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:22.760
Dobrze, piątek mi pasuje. O której się spotkamy?

6
00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:25.850
Spotkajmy się o szóstej przed kinem.

7
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.820
Świetnie. Do zobaczenia!

8
00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:33.210
Może pójdziemy do kina?

9
00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:37.850
A suggestion opens with the word for maybe.

10
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:43.680
To decline politely, say unfortunately and add a reason.

11
00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:47.310
Then agree on the time and the place.

12
00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:51.870
Suggest going to the cinema.

13
00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:55.970
Może pójdziemy do kina?

14
00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:00.530
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

15
00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:03.930
Może pójdziemy do kina?

16
00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:08.290
Ask what time you will meet.

17
00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:12.510
O której się spotkamy?

18
00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:17.070
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

19
00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.590
O której się spotkamy?

20
00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:26.230
Now practise with the exercises below the video.
